  "name": "Control Network B",
  "cellSizeM": 2.0,
  "notes": [
    "Tier 3 with zigzag lanes: every route steps up or down at least twice before reaching the control-room module.",
    "Route A: conveyor on the stepped section (A2), gate (A3), final hazard (A4), then the final code note. Route B: cart ride (B2), a patrolled loop, gate (B3), final hazard (B4), then the final token.",
    "Route C: conveyor mid-route (C2), gate (C3), then the final service cart on the last run (C4).",
    "A3, B3 and C3 accept the carried T2_OPS and T1_MAINT permissions as optional shortcuts."
  ],
